---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import V2Page from "../components/V2Page.astro";
---

<Site
  title="Welcome aboard — Better Business Web"
  description="Payment received, and welcome aboard. Your plan is active and we'll be in touch to get things started."
  noindex
  hideHeader
  bg="v2"
>
  <V2Page
    eyebrow="Payment received"
    title="You're all set."
    description="Your plan is active and a receipt is on its way. We'll follow up with the kickoff details, gather what we need, and start shaping your first working preview."
    align="center"
    actions={[{ href: "/", label: "Back to home" }]}
  >
    <section class="v2-section">
      <div class="v2-shell">
        <div class="v2-grid">
          <article class="v2-card v2-card-pad">
            <span class="v2-card-kicker">01</span>
            <h3>Kickoff</h3>
            <p>Within one business day, we'll email you a short list of what we need: your logo, a few photos, your hours, and account access.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="v2-card v2-card-pad">
            <span class="v2-card-kicker">02</span>
            <h3>Preview</h3>
            <p>This week we get the site and setup underway, then share a preview link so you can watch it come together.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="v2-card v2-card-pad">
            <span class="v2-card-kicker">03</span>
            <h3>Ongoing</h3>
            <p>Your monthly plan covers hosting, updates, and the services in your package. Reply whenever you need something.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </V2Page>
</Site>
